# DECIDE NOW
{%- if G and G.state == "SELECTING_HAND" %}
1. A listed play marked WINS? -> play its indices (own Square Joker? play the "Suggested action": it pads the play to 4 cards).
2. DISCARDS > 0 and no listed play WINS? -> discard the "Suggested discard" indices to dig toward a winning play (it keeps your best play's cards); if it says "none", or Discard costs are listed and the dig is not worth them, go to 3.
3. Otherwise -> play the "Suggested action" indices (or the highest listed play).
{%- elif G and G.state == "SHOP" %}
1. Affordable on-plan [XMULT] joker, not [OFF-PLAN] (price <= SCORE_SPENDABLE), or tier S/A [MAIN]/[MULT] joker (or tier A [ECON] costing $7 or less while ECON_OK = YES; tier B+ [ECON] in Antes 1-2) with price <= SPENDABLE (SCORE_SPENDABLE for SCORE +50%) and SLOTS_FREE > 0? -> buy it. Otherwise follow PRIORITY (first unchecked GOAL).
2. Planet marked [MAIN] (price <= SCORE_SPENDABLE) or [FEED], or a [BUY] voucher with price <= SPENDABLE? -> buy it (then use the planet).
3. Pack or reroll allowed by the SHOP RULES (Spectral packs are worth opening; Standard pack while BLUE_SEALS = 0 or you own Hologram)? -> do it. Otherwise -> next_round.
{%- elif G and G.state == "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED" %}
1. Pick the best card by the PACK RULES (pass Suggested targets as `targets`), or skip if nothing qualifies.
{%- endif %}
Reply with exactly one tool call. Put your short reasoning first.
